39:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-900","children":"Transportation at 31 percent and schedule conflict at 24 percent sum to 55 percent — more than half of all withdrawals — while academic difficulty accounts for 16 percent. That combination supports both halves of the author's claim."}]
